WEBVTT

00:00:29.967 --> 00:00:30.947
nestali

00:00:31.777 --> 00:00:34.287
i ostao nam je misterij.

00:00:35.417 --> 00:00:39.125
Čini se da to ljudi nisu mogli izgraditi.

00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:41.875
Jer ljudi i nisu.

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:47.101
To je gradila drevna rasa divova,

00:00:47.125 --> 00:00:48.393
zvana Kiklopi.

00:00:48.417 --> 00:00:49.726
(Smijeh)

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:51.976
Ja sam surađivao s tim gorostasima

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.250
kako bih naučio tajne 
micanja masivnog kamenja.

00:00:56.667 --> 00:01:00.827
I pokazalo se da Kiklopi 
nisu bili posebno snažni.